    <string name="channel_edit_while_off">关闭时仍可调整并保存参数，开启后才会应用。</string>
    <string name="channel_processing_rate">处理采样率 · %1$s</string>
    <string name="channel_pan_title">声像定位</string>
    <string name="channel_pan_hint">调整声音的左右偏向，居中时保持两侧平衡。</string>
    <string name="channel_trim_title">独立声道增益</string>
    <string name="channel_gain_estimate_note">计算增益仅反映声像与增益设置，不包含极性、音色、延迟及单声道映射，也不是实时电平。</string>
    <string name="channel_estimated_gain">计算增益 · %1$s</string>
